        "markdown": "[Home](/) · [Departments](/departments) · [Services](/services) · [Contact](/contact)\n\n# Island Hardware & Marine\n\nTools, paint, plumbing, electrical and marine supplies in Public, Gustavia. Serving the island's builders and boat crews since 1984.\n\n## Departments\n\n- Hand and power tools\n- Marine hardware, rope and antifouling\n- Plumbing and electrical\n- Paint (colour matching in store)\n- Garden and pool chemicals\n- Fasteners in stainless steel\n\n## Services\n\n- Key cutting while you wait\n- Propane refills\n- Tool rental: pressure washer €50 per day, generator €90 per day\n- Delivery to the port and to boatyards from €150 of purchases\n\n## Hours\n\nMon–Fri 7am–5pm, Sat 7am–12pm. Closed Sundays and public holidays.\n\nIsland Hardware & Marine, Zone Industrielle de Public, Gustavia 97133\nPhone +590 590 00 32 34 · sales@islandhardwaremarine.example\n\nTrade accounts available for contractors. Cards and cash accepted. English and French spoken.\n\n© Island Hardware & Marine · Cookies · Privacy"
